{"page":559,"verses":[{"verse_key":"65:6","surah":65,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"أَسْكِنُوهُنَّ مِنْ حَيْثُ سَكَنتُم مِّن وُجْدِكُمْ وَلَا تُضَآرُّوهُنَّ لِتُضَيِّقُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ ۚ وَإِن كُنَّ أُو۟لَـٰتِ حَمْلٍ فَأَنفِقُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ حَتَّىٰ يَضَعْنَ حَمْلَهُنَّ ۚ فَإِنْ أَرْضَعْنَ لَكُمْ فَـَٔاتُوهُنَّ أُجُورَهُنَّ ۖ وَأْتَمِرُوا۟ بَيْنَكُم بِمَعْرُوفٍ ۖ وَإِن تَعَاسَرْتُمْ فَسَتُرْضِعُ لَهُۥٓ أُخْرَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"House the wives you are divorcing according to your means, wherever you house yourselves, and do not harass them so as to make their lives difficult. If they are pregnant, maintain them until they are delivered of their burdens; if they suckle your infants, pay them for it. Consult together in a good way- if you make difficulties for one another, another woman may suckle the child for the father––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَسْكِنُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"Lodge them","transliteration":"askinūhunna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَكَنتُم","en_gloss":"you dwell","transliteration":"sakantum","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"(out) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وُجْدِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your means","transliteration":"wuj'dikum","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُضَآرُّوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"harm them","transliteration":"tuḍārrūhunna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِتُضَيِّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"to distress","transliteration":"lituḍayyiqū","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ ۚ","en_gloss":"[on] them","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنَّ","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"kunna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"those (who are)","transliteration":"ulāti","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَمْلٍۢ","en_gloss":"pregnant","transliteration":"ḥamlin","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَأَنفِقُوا۟","en_gloss":"then spend","transliteration":"fa-anfiqū","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَضَعْنَ","en_gloss":"they deliver","transliteration":"yaḍaʿna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حَمْلَهُنَّ ۚ","en_gloss":"their burden","transliteration":"ḥamlahunna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَرْضَعْنَ","en_gloss":"they suckle","transliteration":"arḍaʿna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَـَٔاتُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"then give them","transliteration":"faātūhunna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":24,"ar":"أُجُورَهُنَّ ۖ","en_gloss":"their payment","transliteration":"ujūrahunna","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":25,"ar":"وَأْتَمِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and consult","transliteration":"watamirū","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":26,"ar":"بَيْنَكُم","en_gloss":"among yourselves","transliteration":"baynakum","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بِمَعْرُوفٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"with kindness","transliteration":"bimaʿrūfin","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":28,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"but if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":29,"ar":"تَعَاسَرْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you disagree","transliteration":"taʿāsartum","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":30,"ar":"فَسَتُرْضِعُ","en_gloss":"then may suckle","transliteration":"fasatur'ḍiʿu","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":31,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":32,"ar":"أُخْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"another (women)","transliteration":"ukh'rā","verse_key":"65:6"},{"pos":33,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"65:6"}]},{"verse_key":"65:7","surah":65,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"لِيُنفِقْ ذُو سَعَةٍ مِّن سَعَتِهِۦ ۖ وَمَن قُدِرَ عَلَيْهِ رِزْقُهُۥ فَلْيُنفِقْ مِمَّآ ءَاتَىٰهُ ٱللَّهُ ۚ لَا يُكَلِّفُ ٱللَّهُ نَفْسًا إِلَّا مَآ ءَاتَىٰهَا ۚ سَيَجْعَلُ ٱللَّهُ بَعْدَ عُسْرٍ يُسْرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and let the wealthy man spend according to his wealth. But let him whose provision is restricted spend according to what God has given him: God does not burden any soul with more than He has given it- after hardship, God will bring ease.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيُنفِقْ","en_gloss":"Let spend","transliteration":"liyunfiq","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ذُو","en_gloss":"owner","transliteration":"dhū","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَعَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) ample means","transliteration":"saʿatin","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَعَتِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"his ample means","transliteration":"saʿatihi","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and (he) who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُدِرَ","en_gloss":"is restricted","transliteration":"qudira","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رِزْقُهُۥ","en_gloss":"his provision","transliteration":"riz'quhu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَلْيُنفِقْ","en_gloss":"let him spend","transliteration":"falyunfiq","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِمَّآ","en_gloss":"from what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"he has been given","transliteration":"ātāhu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Does not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُكَلِّفُ","en_gloss":"burden","transliteration":"yukallifu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"نَفْسًا","en_gloss":"any soul","transliteration":"nafsan","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"(with) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"He has given it","transliteration":"ātāhā","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":21,"ar":"سَيَجْعَلُ","en_gloss":"Will bring about","transliteration":"sayajʿalu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":23,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":24,"ar":"عُسْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"hardship","transliteration":"ʿus'rin","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":25,"ar":"يُسْرًۭا","en_gloss":"ease","transliteration":"yus'ran","verse_key":"65:7"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"65:7"}]},{"verse_key":"65:8","surah":65,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن مِّن قَرْيَةٍ عَتَتْ عَنْ أَمْرِ رَبِّهَا وَرُسُلِهِۦ فَحَاسَبْنَـٰهَا حِسَابًا شَدِيدًا وَعَذَّبْنَـٰهَا عَذَابًا نُّكْرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Many a town that insolently opposed the command of its Lord and His messengers We have brought sternly to account: We punished them severely","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَأَيِّن","en_gloss":"And how many","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَرْيَةٍ","en_gloss":"a town","transliteration":"qaryatin","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَتَتْ","en_gloss":"rebelled","transliteration":"ʿatat","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَنْ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَمْرِ","en_gloss":"(the) Command","transliteration":"amri","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَبِّهَا","en_gloss":"(of) its Lord","transliteration":"rabbihā","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرُسُلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Messengers","transliteration":"warusulihi","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَحَاسَبْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"so We took it to account","transliteration":"faḥāsabnāhā","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حِسَابًۭا","en_gloss":"an account","transliteration":"ḥisāban","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"شَدِيدًۭا","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdan","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَعَذَّبْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"and We punished it","transliteration":"waʿadhabnāhā","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نُّكْرًۭا","en_gloss":"terrible","transliteration":"nuk'ran","verse_key":"65:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"65:8"}]},{"verse_key":"65:9","surah":65,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"فَذَاقَتْ وَبَالَ أَمْرِهَا وَكَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ أَمْرِهَا خُسْرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"to make them taste the ill effect of their conduct- the result of their conduct was ruin.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَذَاقَتْ","en_gloss":"So it tasted","transliteration":"fadhāqat","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَبَالَ","en_gloss":"(the bad) consequence","transliteration":"wabāla","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْرِهَا","en_gloss":"(of) its affair","transliteration":"amrihā","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"and was","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَمْرِهَا","en_gloss":"(of) its affair","transliteration":"amrihā","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"خُسْرًا","en_gloss":"loss","transliteration":"khus'ran","verse_key":"65:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٩","en_gloss":"(9)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"65:9"}]},{"verse_key":"65:10","surah":65,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"أَعَدَّ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمْ عَذَابًا شَدِيدًا ۖ فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ۚ قَدْ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ إِلَيْكُمْ ذِكْرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has prepared a severe torment for them. So, you who have understanding, you who believe, beware of God. He has sent you the Quran","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"Has prepared","transliteration":"aʿadda","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَدِيدًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdan","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"So fear","transliteration":"fa-ittaqū","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى","en_gloss":"O men","transliteration":"yāulī","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) understanding","transliteration":"l-albābi","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"have believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"Has sent down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ذِكْرًۭا","en_gloss":"a Message","transliteration":"dhik'ran","verse_key":"65:10"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"65:10"}]},{"verse_key":"65:11","surah":65,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"رَّسُولًا يَتْلُوا۟ عَلَيْكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ مُبَيِّنَـٰتٍ لِّيُخْرِجَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ مِنَ ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ إِلَى ٱلنُّورِ ۚ وَمَن يُؤْمِنۢ بِٱللَّهِ وَيَعْمَلْ صَـٰلِحًا يُدْخِلْهُ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا ۖ قَدْ أَحْسَنَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُۥ رِزْقًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and a messenger- reciting to you God’s revelations that make things clear- to bring those who believe and do righteous deeds from darkness into light. God will admit those who believe in Him and do righteous deeds into Gardens graced with flowing streams, where they will remain for ever––He has made good provision for them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَّسُولًۭا","en_gloss":"A Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlan","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتْلُوا۟","en_gloss":"reciting","transliteration":"yatlū","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) Verses","transliteration":"āyāti","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُبَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubayyinātin","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِّيُخْرِجَ","en_gloss":"that he may bring out","transliteration":"liyukh'rija","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"65:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss"